LESIZE, ALL, , , NDIVX
LSEL, S, LOC, X, -L $ LSEL, A, LOC, X, L
LESIZE, ALL, , , NDIVY
ALLSEL, ALL
MSHKEY, 1 $ AMESH, ALL
! mirror cut at Y=0: ASYM (ANTI) pattern in GLOBAL Cartesian
NSEL, S, LOC, Y, 0
D, ALL, UX, 0 $ D, ALL, UZ, 0 $ D, ALL, ROTY, 0
